{"unit_id":"anweat__dsh-voice-webspeech#feature-1","repo":"anweat/dsh-voice-webspeech","commit":"38c0120054ce1f241e9e12a4324d9a1d1d2befba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-webspeech 的功能「语音输入按钮」：在会话输入框工具栏注入麦克风控件；按住或切换录音模式启动识别，识别文字可进入草稿。 触发方式为在 DSH Web 输入框使用麦克风或调整语音设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:24-32"]}
